---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const page = {
  title: "Become An Agent",
  h1: "Become Our Cooperator",
  description: "Become Our Cooperator | Avian DNA & PCR Testing Partnership Program",
  canonical: "/become-an-agent/",
  author: "",
  date: "",
};
const hreflang = "<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en-US\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/ar/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ja\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/ja/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko-KR\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/ko/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ko\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/ko/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es-ES\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/es/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/es/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr-FR\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/fr/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/fr/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de-DE\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/de/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/de/become-an-agent/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://aviantestpro.com/become-an-agent/\" />";
---
<BaseLayout title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogType="article">
  <article class="page-content">
    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p><br><br>Become Our Cooperator | Avian DNA &amp; PCR Testing Partnership Program</p><p>We welcome long-term cooperation with partners worldwide in the field of avian molecular diagnostics, bird DNA testing, PCR detection services, and laboratory development.</p><p>Our cooperation network includes bird breeders, veterinary laboratories, distributors, regional agents, wildlife organizations, avian researchers, and laboratory investors.</p><p>If you are interested in developing avian genetic testing or pathogen detection services in your region, we invite you to contact us for partnership opportunities.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>Partnership Opportunities</h2><h3>Regional Business Agents</h3><p>We are actively seeking regional representatives and market agents to promote avian DNA testing and PCR diagnostic services in local markets.</p><p>Partners may develop local client networks for:</p><ul><li>Bird DNA sex identification services</li><li>Pigeon genetic testing</li><li>Avian virus PCR testing</li><li>Laboratory reagent distribution</li><li>Sample collection and submission support</li></ul><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><figure class="wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized">
<img src="/images/Letter-of-Authorization-for-Rob-2_01.png" alt="Certificate of our regional exclusive agent" width="709" height="1024" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
<figcaption class="wp-element-caption">Certificate of Our Regional Exclusive Agent</figcaption></figure><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h3>Promotion &amp; Marketing Partners</h3><p>We welcome cooperation with online platforms, avian communities, breeders, pigeon clubs, veterinary channels, and digital marketing partners.</p><p>Marketing cooperation may include:</p><ul><li>Brand promotion collaboration</li><li>Referral partnerships</li><li>Joint educational projects</li><li>Technical content cooperation</li><li>Regional market development</li></ul><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h3>Laboratory Construction &amp; Technical Cooperation</h3><p>We support partners interested in establishing local avian molecular testing laboratories.</p><p>Our laboratory cooperation support may include:</p><ul><li>PCR laboratory workflow design</li><li>Equipment selection guidance</li><li>Reagent system recommendations</li><li>Testing protocol optimization</li><li>Technical training assistance</li><li>Laboratory startup consultation</li></ul><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>Advantages of Working With Us</h2><h3>Competitive Partner Profit Structure</h3><p>We provide strong commercial support and competitive pricing policies for long-term partners and regional cooperators.</p><p>Our goal is to help partners establish sustainable local business growth with reasonable profit margins and scalable development opportunities.</p><p>🛡️ <strong>Exclusive Territory Protection</strong>: For qualified tier-1 regional partners, SENO Biotech offers <strong>strict market exclusivity agreements</strong>. We actively protect your local market share by redirecting local leads and inbound purchase inquiries within your designated region directly to your network.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h3>Priority Testing Services</h3><p>Cooperators and agents receive priority processing support for laboratory testing services and sample handling workflows.</p><p>This helps improve turnaround efficiency and customer experience in local markets.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h3>Technical Support System</h3><p>We provide ongoing technical support related to:</p><ul><li>Bird DNA testing workflows</li><li>PCR and qPCR systems</li><li>Sample collection procedures</li><li>Laboratory operation guidance</li><li>Testing interpretation support</li></ul><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h3>Product &amp; Reagent Support</h3><p>Partners may access avian molecular diagnostic reagents and PCR detection kits for:</p><ul><li>Bird sex identification</li><li>Pigeon pathogen detection</li><li>Parrot disease screening</li><li>Avian molecular biology applications</li></ul><p>✈️ <strong>Regulatory Compliance &amp; Global Cold-Chain Support</strong>: Our export department ensures that all avian diagnostic kits are packed with specialized clinical-grade thermal insulation (dry ice/gel packs). We provide comprehensive commercial documentation, including <strong>Certificate of Analysis (COA), Safety Data Sheets (SDS/MSDS), and export compliance records</strong>, to ensure smooth customs clearance at major international hubs.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>Who Can Apply?</h2><p>We welcome cooperation inquiries from:</p><ul><li>Bird breeding farms</li><li>Pigeon racing organizations</li><li>Veterinary laboratories</li><li>Wildlife conservation groups</li><li>Avian research institutions</li><li>Biotechnology distributors</li><li>Entrepreneurs interested in molecular diagnostics</li></ul><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>Global Cooperation Development</h2><p>Our current international cooperation includes clients and partners from:</p><ul><li>Middle East</li><li>North America</li><li>Europe</li><li>Oceania</li><li>Asia</li></ul><p>We continue expanding our global avian molecular diagnostics cooperation network.</p><hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/><h2>How To Apply</h2><h3>Our Partnership Onboarding Process</h3><ul><li><strong>Step 1: Initial Inquiry &amp; Verification</strong> Submit your business profile, target market, and operational capacity via our partnership application channel below.</li><li><strong>Step 2: Quotation &amp; Agreement Formulation</strong> Our international business development managers (Martin Wong / Aaron Wong) will schedule a review to discuss customized agent pricing tiers, minimum order quantities (MOQ), and territory rights.</li><li><strong>Step 3: Technical Setup &amp; Inventory Dispatch</strong> Upon signing, our laboratory specialists will provide you with all required technical dossiers, SOP manuals, marketing assets, and dispatch your initial inventory via validated international cold chain.</li></ul></div></div><p></p></div>`} />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
